1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 20=

10
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:57,350
The Marquis Yongping
requests an audience.

11
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,920
I pay my respects to Your Majesty.

12
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,510
Why is it you?

13
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:05,950
Where is Liu?

14
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:13,710
Your Majesty,

15
00:01:13,710 --> 00:01:14,790
Consort Great Liu is...

16
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:15,640
Father,

17
00:01:16,210 --> 00:01:18,350
I'm afraid you will not
get to see Consort Great Liu.

18
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,950
She was killed.

19
00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:22,280
It was Qi Zhen who did it.

20
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:26,280
Prince Qi.

21
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:27,400
I'm innocent!

22
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:35,000
How could this happen?

23
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,640
My poor sister.

24
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:38,760
His Majesty and I

25
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:41,200
didn't even get to see you one last time.

26
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:44,230
How could you leave us just like that?

27
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,430
Your Majesty.

28
00:01:46,950 --> 00:01:49,760
You must stand up for my sister.

29
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,430
Qi Zhao.

30
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,230
You speak.

31
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,200
Your Majesty,

32
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,200
I saw my father poison Consort Great Liu

33
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:00,790
with my own eyes.

34
00:02:00,950 --> 00:02:01,870
Qi Zhao!

35
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:02,870
You rebellious son!

36
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:04,640
You're conspiring with outsiders
to frame me!

37
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:08,680
Tell Qi Zhao to come here and tell him

38
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:13,080
that Qi Yuan killed Qi Jin.

39
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,120
Consort Great Liu is about to return.

40
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,560
Please look after the Qi family

41
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,710
for me.

42
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:21,240
Qi Yuan and the others

43
00:02:21,250 --> 00:02:22,970
have found
Consort Great Liu's whereabouts.

44
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:25,080
They will bring her home
in the next few days.

45
00:02:27,330 --> 00:02:28,710
His Lordship sent me to bring food.

46
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:35,360
Rebellious son!

47
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,280
How dare you!

48
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:37,750
Your Majesty!

49
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,150
I am innocent!

50
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,910
Tell me.

51
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,800
What exactly is going on?

52
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:44,960
Your Majesty,

53
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,310
I saw for myself

54
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,760
that the Marquis Yongping
went through a lot

55
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,080
to bring Consort Great Liu back.

56
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,430
If he intended to harm her,

57
00:02:50,510 --> 00:02:52,500
why wait until Her Highness
returned to the capital?

58
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,590
There must be more to this.

59
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,750
Please investigate carefully,
Your Majesty.

60
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:56,080
The evidence is conclusive.

61
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,150
Consort Great Liu's body

62
00:02:58,150 --> 00:02:59,520
is in Guanyin Temple.

63
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,950
What more do you need to investigate?

64
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:01,650
Your Majesty...

65
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:02,360
Father...

66
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,120
All of you, shut up!

67
00:03:05,750 --> 00:03:06,590
Guards,

68
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:10,430
take Qi Zhen down first.

69
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:11,590
Your Majesty!

70
00:03:11,660 --> 00:03:12,310
I am innocent!

71
00:03:12,310 --> 00:03:12,960
Your Majesty!

72
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,430
I am innocent!

73
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,990
- Consort Great Liu requests an audience.
- Your Majesty.

74
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:16,430
It has been many years.

75
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,840
How have you been, Your Majesty?

76
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,190
Liu...

77
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,590
Liu.

78
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:45,470
Just now...

79
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:46,310
Just now,

80
00:03:46,910 --> 00:03:47,630
they said...

81
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:49,360
I was dead.

82
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,590
Your Majesty,

83
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,280
the Marquis Qi went
through so much trouble

84
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,710
to bring me back.

85
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:58,870
You should not doubt him.

86
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,430
It is some people

87
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,430
with sinister intentions.

88
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:05,240
Impossible.

89
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:06,710
You are not her.

90
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,710
I saw it with my own eyes.

91
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:09,070
My father poisoned Consort Great Liu.

92
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:10,190
You are not her.

93
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:11,470
Your Majesty,

94
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:13,840
if you don't trust me,

95
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,310
may I ask if you still remember

96
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,120
"Snow falling on plum branches,

97
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,160
and never regretting it"?

98
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:25,750
The moon's shadow is sparse,
and I return with snow in my arms.

99
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,680
We wrote those lines together

100
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:35,600
for the Qionghua Tune.

101
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,560
Only you and I knew them.

102
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,070
It is not real.

103
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,430
Liu...

104
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,390
It really is you.

105
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,170
Your Majesty, she is fake.

106
00:04:44,190 --> 00:04:44,830
She is not real.

107
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:45,600
Shut up.

108
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,680
You framed your own father

109
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,270
and deceived the Emperor.

110
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,430
What was your plan?

111
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:51,870
Your Majesty.

112
00:04:51,870 --> 00:04:52,270
Guards!

113
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,120
Take him away.

114
00:04:54,430 --> 00:04:55,560
Interrogate him thoroughly.

115
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,240
Your Majesty!

116
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:56,800
Qi Zhao.

117
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,390
How dare you deceive me!

118
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,160
Fortunately, Father saw through it all.

119
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:02,160
Take him away.

120
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,430
Your Majesty!

121
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:04,600
- Your Majesty!
- Go.

122
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,680
I'm being framed, Your Majesty!

123
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:07,720
I'm being framed!

124
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,360
Liu,

125
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,070
it's good that you are back.

126
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,800
All these years,

127
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:15,480
I have thought of you
every moment of every day.

128
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,480
I never even dared to imagine

129
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,750
that one day,

130
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:21,000
the two of us would see each other again.

131
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:23,950
Back then, it was all
because of the bandits

132
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:26,480
that we were separated.

133
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,800
I have been heartbroken ever since.

134
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,800
Your Majesty,

135
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:35,360
I have missed you day and night.

136
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:38,870
Even in my dreams,
I was reunited with Your Majesty.

137
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:42,120
As for those bandits,

138
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:44,000
Your Majesty need not blame yourself.

139
00:05:44,950 --> 00:05:46,430
I have come here today

140
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,800
to settle accounts with

141
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,300
the true culprit behind those bandits.

142
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:51,480
Your Majesty,

143
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,120
the true culprit behind the bandits

144
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:56,480
was my own sister.

145
00:05:58,830 --> 00:06:00,070
Please, Your Majesty,

146
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,720
for the Commandery Princess
and the Prince Consort

147
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,680
who died in that bandit attack,

148
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,600
please uphold justice.

149
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,800
Liu,

150
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:09,750
get up first.

151
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,310
Consort Little Liu,

152
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,680
you actually murdered your own sister.

153
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,360
Your Majesty,

154
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,510
I...

155
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:19,750
I am innocent!

156
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,680
Father,

157
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,240
my mother has a pure and kind nature.

158
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,750
She would never murder her own sister.

159
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,360
Your Majesty,

160
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,920
my sister and I grew up together.

161
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,120
How could I possibly have murdered her?

162
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,720
Sister,

163
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:39,430
we've finally reunited
after so many years.

164
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,920
Why would you

165
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,040
slander me?

166
00:06:42,310 --> 00:06:43,000
Could it be

167
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,360
I'm the only one

168
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,830
who still remembers those days?

169
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,680
All these years,

170
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:51,120
I have always dreamed of you.

171
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,360
When we were children,

172
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:54,480
you climbed a tree
to help me get my kite.

173
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:58,240
Then you accidentally fell down

174
00:06:58,270 --> 00:07:00,680
and had a scar on your hand.

175
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,310
So many years have passed.

176
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:04,600
Has that scar faded?

177
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,800
Sister.

178
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,430
Where is your scar?

179
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:10,510
Father,

180
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,920
she is not Consort Great Liu.

181
00:07:17,510 --> 00:07:18,360
Qi Yuan!

182
00:07:18,390 --> 00:07:19,040
Your Majesty,

183
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,240
how can it be Qi Yuan?

184
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,720
How dare you!

185
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:24,000
You disguised yourself
as Consort Great Liu and fooled me.

186
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,900
And you tried to frame
Consort Little Liu too.

187
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,240
Your Majesty,

188
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,720
Consort Great Liu's sudden death

189
00:07:30,830 --> 00:07:32,270
wasn't done by the Qi family.

190
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,160
But the bandit incident

191
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,750
was indeed done by Consort Little Liu.

192
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,390
Please investigate carefully,
Your Majesty.

193
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,480
Nonsense!

194
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,390
Your Majesty,

195
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,830
Consort Great Liu's sudden death

196
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,310
must have some hidden truth.

197
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:47,160
Please allow me to
investigate it thoroughly.

198
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:47,800
The Qi family

199
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,000
has long been in league
with Xiao Yunting.

200
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,950
Are you trying to destroy the evidence

201
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,190
and deceive His Majesty?

202
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:54,240
I have no such intention.

203
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,190
I only want to uncover the truth.

204
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,310
Why are you so determined to stop me?

205
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,240
Silence!

206
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,600
Guards.

207
00:08:00,610 --> 00:08:02,230
Take the entire
Marquis Yongping Residence

208
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,190
to the Court of Judicial Review.

209
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,390
Hold them until further notice.

210
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:06,720
Grandfather!

211
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,480
Yunting.

212
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,040
As a son,

213
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:10,000
with Father gravely ill,

214
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,390
you've left him aside.

215
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:13,480
All you do is shield the Qi family.

216
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,120
Guards,

217
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:16,920
send Prince Jing back
to the Eastern Palace.

218
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,040
Without my decree,

219
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,360
he is not to step out
of the Eastern Palace.

220
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,700
Please think again, Your Majesty.

221
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:22,160
I have made up my mind.

222
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:23,950
Do you really want me to

223
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:25,720
charge you and the Qi family

224
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,870
with forming cliques for private gain?

225
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:43,150
I obey the decree.

226
00:08:49,270 --> 00:08:49,910
Grandmother.

227
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:53,080
I didn't think it through.

228
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,120
This is not your fault.

229
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,120
It is the elders' fault.

230
00:08:59,030 --> 00:09:00,200
Look at you two.

231
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,790
You raised such a fine son.

232
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,670
What a lovely family.

233
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:10,960
Qi Yuan.

234
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,360
At this point,

235
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:15,000
as long as you agree to marry me,

236
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:18,870
I can release your whole family.

237
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,390
Prince Qi,

238
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:23,030
marriage

239
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:24,550
must be by mutual consent.

240
00:09:24,910 --> 00:09:25,960
Is that so?

241
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:29,000
You're mad!

242
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,910
If you keep talking nonsense,

243
00:09:32,550 --> 00:09:34,440
I will have their heads cut off.

244
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:37,200
Let me ask you one more time.

245
00:09:41,670 --> 00:09:44,390
Will you marry me or not?

246
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:51,630
(Now that I have my grandparents
who love me,)

247
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:52,630
(and this family,)

248
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:56,080
(how could I watch them die
because of me?)

249
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:01,790
Oh, Qi Yuan.

250
00:10:02,550 --> 00:10:04,790
Family really is your weakness.

251
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,150
As long as the Qi family

252
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:09,550
is in my hands,

253
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:12,150
you'll do as I say.

254
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,790
This wine

255
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,790
is laced with Paralyzing Powder.

256
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,910
Drink it,
and your martial arts will be crippled.

257
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:24,480
You'll belong to me forever.

258
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:25,550
Drink it.

259
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:27,790
What?

260
00:10:27,790 --> 00:10:29,630
Would you rather watch your grandfather

261
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:30,790
die right in front of you?

262
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:48,670
At last, you're mine.

263
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:13,570
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

264
00:11:13,950 --> 00:11:17,730
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

265
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:23,700
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

266
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:28,080
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

267
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:33,150
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

268
00:11:33,950 --> 00:11:40,850
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
